 the other hand, static annotation images use less memory"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and draw more quickly than annotation views."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The user location annotation view can also be customized via this method. When","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"annotation","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is an instance of "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNUserLocation"},{"type":"text","text":" (or equal to the map view’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"userLocation","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" property), return an instance of ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNUserLocationAnnotationView"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(or a subclass thereof).","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"heading","level":4,"anchor":"Related-examples","text":"Related examples"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"TODO: Add annotation views and images, learn how to specify what"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNAnnotation","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" to use for a given "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNAnnotation","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" object on your"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"map."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"references":{"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNUserLocation":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The MLNUserLocation class defines a specific type of annotation that identifies"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the user’s current location. You do not create instances of this class"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"directly. Instead, you retrieve 